 "caveats": [
  "Fitted and tested on prices only: the target is the six-way prop market, and no result of any fight it fits or tests on is read.",
  "The error table is measured fitting on 2016-2020 and testing on 2021-2024. The frozen fit live cards read is fitted on 2016-2024, and its error on a live card cannot be measured (no live prop price exists): the test table is the nearest measure.",
  "History's moneyline is the closing line (odds.csv); a live card reads its own pair, a different snapshot, so a live estimate may miss by more than the table.",
  "The dev choice (ridge penalty, prior weight) was made fitting 2016-2019 and checking 2020, and every yearly refit uses it, so a backtest refit for a year up to 2020 uses a choice that saw that year's prices (prices only, never a result).",
  "History has no prop after 2024-12-07; the fit rows start in 2016, so there is no refit before 2016.",
  "An estimate is what a book would probably charge, not an edge: the six-way market's median overround is 22.5% across its six outcomes, the moneyline pair's 4.0%."
 ]
